# frontend/assets/reticlex_core.wasm is a build artifact but is deliberately
# committed: the front end can then be opened and reviewed without a C++
# toolchain. Regenerate it with scripts/build-wasm.sh; CI rebuilds it and runs
# the tests against the fresh module on every push.

